    {
      "id": "8744358a-3100-48e5-ad49-3eed236999cc",
      "title": "Escute a frase e ligue o adjetivo ao comportamento da cena.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a183944b-4aa2-4568-b713-efd1b1cb6f3d",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Es tímido.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Ele é tímido.</strong></p><p>Essa frase combina com quem demora mais para entrar na conversa e costuma ouvir antes de falar.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f6fc2a36f90442fb947392cdb8bd9bb8_b04-es-timido.mp3?Expires=1794099516&Signature=lfoDigVC7kmbidu32GDnnAPJB5LGg-c68ShSk4uylbE5QoegGGGKl7gpgR03ABM8AzmdRbvrJSaiZEOfHaRU2gQZkyEZOHE~NWJWpv7DeeKKOwm1MG5vpU7Qm2O0l5peztCC8Ys1jfEw3uOf7H-uIawOwgB~shz97cIWXMZ2FIgbLZE~H9xArEyCdfTuoadAyWt3W9kI3ptXKVAxD5yG7QhBL6hKfK~3LiMCfFQFr6cJ1SGkMO6h1iYmrNSpzOTV0JXRIcvLUR7bWMt7Ma~GVxHHKGpdHpeZZzxhqMBQHQvdSo8OWlhomCzlcC48ckBUlBwXUZgKB69dux-NCE-Xzw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
