      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5580bc72-4b21-4dfb-ac1d-d4fc7944e9fb",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e note que agora o foco está na ação.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e2a99131-dbae-4bbc-89a0-be096bc11dae",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora o foco não é o adjetivo, e sim o quanto a pessoa fala.</p><p><strong>Habla mucho.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Ela fala muito.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0abfb79b1ac64a6da01326811c543886_b01-simpatica-scene.png?Expires=1794099516&Signature=bl0gwx0DN4SwRDIQnpo7N4wTG00lPKXjrM3HrYzvqfsLqGTtMDrYkjI0kvhN525AvaWuajAZYA4oGJfWqVgYTTdMy1nkHN3kw~zecWfN1Ggsj3wS4sBo52nlSe~E2fLHs3lSLk2tOA6cXNSMyQxHxnUJ8aqAEdEHNbQ~7AcV8LcgJsbrLxE3OTSp6MjNdnymPORde15jbxIx8PrW83NrWSnTpTe4Mgonk11UvZdkZ4whLI4YTDMjBgyZeWQY-FI92gFi3rvnl54eeWe7dSWeFfQ2A9SEqqAyTTchfPt8mHAPHMchBzLLTsp8zIO88m30QJsI0jkmcC4o5mWcJl6cRg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/dac4312303114185a5a4f77ed42b8396_b05-habla-mucho.mp3?Expires=1794099516&Signature=itOOTITUKu5b-sVDttvqbU9KN1TGuyy211WuzggrhkhB~BMgH-1QFT8wyXnOwUS2mWLipOxpqM6neIHsdHbSHBGVnvgo4JPdsALWhnwpg6XMlx-WlxQ5tnXG1rZpHwD7oxcd8xhbTUS5Z-UAi1bLmgE6ET8vm4Q06ZnaYveJwmyFop2oSzwGqAh9tHQd7wYlk8FrdZobwEyL45ORCZIsm9XA5CvXto1LTAGII3GjYMmoGteDWTE3CwYB~Mi4BiH9wxI2B96Q870Ew5Pro3ElB7q7rd2N4ZR3ETaGJ8IUb56NZsA5UCbiX2lgJQqpxEDX1wp0YfdXvv1ONvQzjzDVWw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
